                                "text": "The second servant, however, was not only not \"saved.\" She could not even be classified as \"questing.\" She was an Anglican who was in the household from charity, having been deserted by her navvy husband and been denied Poor Relief by two parishes, each of whom claimed she was the other's responsibility."
